      "comment": "ELLOVAMAN (4) returned from a spell three-and-a-half weeks ago when he was in contention on the corner before being beaten 5 lengths into tenth over 1200m at Bunbury. Strips fitter and can make amends. HOT NOVA (7) was in the money two starts back at Carnarvon but was unable to repeat the effort last time when tenth at Carnarvon over 1200m. Has her share of talent. Hard to beat in this suitable race. LE TROY (2) was always well out of his ground when tenth over 1400m at Carnarvon last start, a less impressive effort than his eighth at Carnarvon the run before. Likely improver with strong prospects. RUN TEDDY RUN (5) turned in another moderate effort last start when 5.5 lengths from the winner in sixth over 1600m at Carnarvon. Has his share of ability and is a top-three prospect. SPACE ACE (6) won't be far away if he runs up to recent form.",
